# a rustc ICE during a corpus/A-B run dumps its backtrace into the CWD, which is the repo root when a
# script `cd`s there first — six landed here in one afternoon (2026-08-31).
/rustc-ice-*.txt
# soundness/run.sh's per-run dylint stream (see its own comment) — a debugging aid, not a checked-in
# artifact.
soundness/.last-run.dylint.log
# coverage-gate: entries.json is a regeneratable ~9MB intermediate (per-crate self-scan output feeding
# classify_check); only covered.tsv/open.tsv, its checked-in DERIVED artifacts, are meant to be committed.
/eval/coverage-gate/entries.json
/eval/coverage-gate/scan_errors.json
